\id 3JN - Diiloŋ-nelma cerma-na 
\ide UTF-8 
\h Nsãa sɛbɛsiɛliŋo 
\toc1 Nsãa sɛbɛsiɛliŋo 
\toc2 Nsãa siɛ. 
\toc3 Nsãa siɛ. 
\mt1 Nsãaŋ 
\mt2 nyɛgãaŋ sɛbɛsiɛliŋo maŋ 
\imt1 Nelmuoyamma 
\ip Nsãa nyɛgãaŋ sɛbɛ daayo‑i hã Diiloŋ-dũŋ-baamba yaatieŋo naŋo‑i baa-yo; ba taa ba bĩ-yo Gawusi. Gawusi taa u kãyã Diiloŋ-dũŋ-baamba‑i ku'i ciɛ Nsãa nyɛgɛ̃ŋ sɛbɛ daayo‑i duɔ jaal-o aa duɔ gbuya-yuɔ wuɔ u bel u fɛrɛ Diyotirɛfu‑i-na kɛrɛ yaatesĩnni dɔlnu-yuɔ a ne da u maacemma saa fa. 
\ip Nsãa gbɛlaaŋ Gawusi‑i bɔi wuɔ u vii baa Diiloŋo‑i aa tiraa firnu u huɔŋga‑i baa Diiloŋ-dũŋ-baamba‑i. U bi kaalaa Diiloŋ-dũŋ-wuoŋo naŋo‑i, ba taa ba bĩ-yo Demetursi. Nuɔmba taa ba bĩ u yefafalle‑i terni-na hiere. 
\ip Nsãa pigãaŋ-ye u sɛbɛ daayo-na wuɔ i baa cu nelbabalaamba huoŋ-nu, i yaŋ aa i tiɛ ce ãnfafamma‑i bãaŋgu‑i baa isuɔŋgu‑i, ku yaa pigãaŋ Diiloŋ-dũŋ-wuoŋo sĩnni‑i. 
\c 1  
\s1 Gawusi wuɔsaaŋgu‑i 
\p  
\v 1 Gawusi, yaatieŋo nyɛgɛ̃ŋ sɛbɛ daayo‑i duɔ hã nuɔnɛi. Kpɔr, coima saa fa, ŋ maama sa suɔ aa dɔlnu-miɛ.  
\v 2 Mi cãrã Diiloŋo‑i da ŋ dii ŋ naŋga‑i mamaŋ nuɔ‑i ma fa ŋ wulaa, aa ŋ kũɔma waa ma fɛrɛŋ nuɔ ŋaa niŋ yeŋ ŋ fɛrɛŋ nuɔ dumaa Diiloŋ-hũmelle-na. 
\p  
\v 3 Tobimba namba juɔ a hel na terieŋgu-na a jo ji tũnu-miɛ wuɔ ŋ bilaa ninsoŋo‑i nammu hãi aa ŋ wuɔ u hũmelle‑i. Nel daama gbuu silaa fɛ̃ mi huɔŋga‑i cor.  
\v 4 Da mi gbuu nu wuɔ mi bisãlmba wuɔ ninsoŋo hũmelle‑i diŋ saaya di wuɔ dumaa, ku yaa fĩɛŋ mi huɔŋga‑i ku yaŋ wɛima‑i hiere. 
\p  
\v 5 Kpɔr, niŋ kãyãŋ tobimba‑i dumaa, ku yaa pigãaŋ wuɔ ŋ wuɔ Diiloŋ-hũmelle‑i fafamma. Halle niŋ fiɛ'a ŋ sa suɔ bamaŋ, ŋ kãyã-bɛi.  
\v 6 Tobimba namba juɔ bande‑i-na aa waŋ-ma baa Diiloŋ-dũŋ-baamba‑i wuɔ ŋ bilaa-ba fafamma. Ta ŋ kãyã-bɛi dumɛi ŋaa Diiloŋ uŋ taaraŋ-kuɔ dumaa, ba ta ba cor baa ba hũmelle‑i.  
\v 7 Ba hilaa ba nilɛiŋa-na Itieŋo maacemma maama'i nuɔ‑i, ba sa hũu bĩŋkũŋgu bamaŋ si dii Yesu horre-na ba wulaa.  
\v 8 Tobimba famba temma‑i, i saaya i dii i naŋga baa-ba a kãyã-bɛi ninsoŋo wamma-na. 
\s1 Diyotirɛfu maama baa Demetursi 
\p  
\v 9 Mi nyɛgãaŋ sɛbɛyuŋgu naŋgu a hã-na Diiloŋ-dũŋgu-na. Ŋga yaatesĩnniŋ dɔlnuŋ Diyotirɛfu‑i, diɛ waŋ mamaŋ u sa ce-ma.  
\v 10 Da mi kã, uŋ ceŋ kumaŋ, mi ka waŋ-ku tũnu-nɛi: U wuɔra u bĩɛna i yirɛiŋa‑i. Aa u saa bãl mafamma-na, tobimba maŋ da ba kã da ba ka har-yuɔ, u yagar. Moloŋ duɔ hũu-ma ba da ba har-yuɔ wuɔ hĩi; aa donya kutieŋo‑i Diiloŋ-dũŋgu-na. 
\p  
\v 11 Kpɔr, baa dii ŋ gboluoŋgu‑i nelbabalaamba maacemma-na, yaŋ aa ŋ cu nelfafaamba. Umaŋ ciɛŋ ãnfafamma‑i, Diiloŋ-wuoŋo. Ŋga umaŋ ciɛŋ kuubabalaaŋgu‑i, u sa suɔ Diiloŋo‑i. 
\p  
\v 12 Kumaŋ ŋaa Demetursi kũŋgu‑i, nuɔmba‑i hiere ba bĩ u yefafalle. Uŋ wuɔ ninsoŋo hũmelle‑i dumaa, ku pigãaŋ wuɔ nelfɛfɛiŋo. Miɛ fɛrɛ‑i i bi bĩ u yefafalle. Aa ŋ suyaa wuɔ iŋ waŋ mamaŋ u kũŋgu-na, ninsoŋo yaa‑i. 
\p  
\v 13 Nelma bɔi dii mi da mi waŋ-ma baa-ni, ŋga mi sa taara mi nyɛgɛ̃ŋ-ma sɛbɛ nuɔ hã-ni.  
\v 14 Diiloŋ duɔ siɛ, ku siɛ vaaya, i ka da i-naa; diɛ da i-naa, i ka saa-ma. 
\p  
\v 15 Diilo kãyã-niɛ. Ŋ jɛ̃naamba pãa-ni jaaluŋgu. Jaal i jɛ̃naamba maŋ dii terieŋgu-na hiere ba da-ba-diei ŋ hã-mi.